<title>MEXICO: SOCCER-MEXICO BEAT COLOMBIA 2-1 IN COPA AMERICA.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-MEXICO BEAT COLOMBIA 2-1 IN COPA AMERICA.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA CRUZ, Bolivia 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico beat</p>
<p>Colombia 2-1 (halftime 2-0) in a Copa America first round,</p>
<p>group C match on Friday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Mexico - Luis Hernandez (10th minute, 15th)</p>
<p>Colombia - Hamilton Ricard (60th)</p>
<p>Attendance: 30,000</p>
